      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Oh my. Will you check on Gardnox Fortress for me?",
        "Jp" : "あらっ、ガルドノック砦の様子を\r\n見て来てくれるの？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446221,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Right then. I'll tell you all I know. Don't wit\r\nif it'll help... but even a scrap of\r\ninformation's better than naught, aye.",
        "Jp" : "それじゃ、あたしが今知ってることを\r\n全部教えておくからね！\r\n役に立つことかはわかんないけど、情報は\r\nちょっとでもあった方がいいでしょ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482261,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Gardnox Fortress has been astir of late. I've\r\nscouted from afar, but the orcs are coming\r\nand going in droves.",
        "Jp" : "最近、ガルドノック砦の方が騒がしくてね\r\n遠目に様子を探ったりもしてるんだけど\r\nオークたちがやけに出たり入ったりしてるんだよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482262,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Mayhap aught's afoot within — preparing to\r\nstrike at us, like as not.",
        "Jp" : "もしかしたら中で何か起こってるかも知れないよ\r\nこっちに攻め込んでくる準備をしてるとかさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482263,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I'm curious myself — when you've had a look\r\ninside, tell me what you found.",
        "Jp" : "あたしも気になってるんだ\r\n中を見てきたら、どんな様子だったか\r\n教えてね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482264,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
    "NpcId" : 1701,
