    }
  }, {
    "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgGroup",
    "GroupNameSerial" : 0,
    "GroupSerial" : 17746,
    "GroupType" : 0,
    "GroupTypeName" : "MSG_GROUP_TYPE_NONE",
    "MsgData" : [ {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Eh?! There were infected orcs\r\nat Gardnox Fortress?!",
        "Jp" : "ええっ！\r\nガルドノック砦に\r\n侵食されたオークが居たのかい！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 446223,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "\"Infected\" — you mean they end up like the\r\nmonsters that washed ashore at Rotes afore,\r\ntheir bodies corrupted?",
        "Jp" : "侵食って、前にローテスの浜辺に\r\n流れ着いたっていう魔物みたいに\r\n体が蝕まれた状態になるんだろ？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482266,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "The corruptions's fell hand draws nigh our lands\r\nas well— Orcs and monsters were trial enow, yet\r\nnow we must dread the infection atop it all...",
        "Jp" : "この辺りにも侵食の魔の手が迫ってるんだね――\r\nオークや魔物だけでも大変なのに\r\nその上に侵食の心配もしなきゃいけないなんて――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482267,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Even so... the orcs have been coming and going of\r\nlate. Calling their kin, trying to save the\r\ninfected... is that the way of it, then?",
        "Jp" : "それにしても、最近オークが頻繁に出入りしてたのは\r\n侵食されたヤツを何とか助けようと\r\n仲間を呼び寄せたりしてたってことなのかね"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482268,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Orcs refusing to abandon their kin... \r\nmayhap they've a redeeming quality after all...",
        "Jp" : "仲間を見捨てないなんて\r\nオークも意外といいとこあるのかもしれないね――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482269,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 12,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You know, when problems arise, people tend to\r\nabandon others or think of them as separate from\r\nthemselves, don't they?\r\nJust like in this village or around\r\nZandra, for example.",
        "Jp" : "人間はさ、問題が起こると見捨てたり\r\n自分たちから切り離して考えがちだろ\r\nこの村やザンドラの辺りみたいにさ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482271,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 13,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "......Seems I overthought it a touch.\r\nNow then, since you've gone and investigated for\r\nus, I can't be forgetting my thanks!\r\nHere, take this with you!",
        "Jp" : "――なんて、ちょっと考えすぎたみたいだ\r\nさて、調査してきてもらったからには\r\nお礼を弾まないとね！\r\nこれ、持って行っておくれよ！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 482270,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
